  "notes": "Inline gate review per ck:quality contract. Controllers enforce server-side roles; tenant-scoped services forward caller.tenantId() to repository predicates; bulk assignment validates every student through IdentityService before any membership lookup/save. Roster uses a parameterized native Page query against the identity-owned read-only view with bounded size and deterministic studentPublicId tie-break. Uniqueness/FK/index constraints back the enrollment invariants. V3/V4 are additive and explicitly document that rollback requires a snapshot or separately reviewed down migration. No legacy projection/event-synchronization artifacts remain in app source; ModuleStructureTest passes.",
